          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మురిసిపోవు (murisipōvu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 5011 lists Telugu muriyu, \"to exult, to be in great glee\", and the verb ends in pōvu, \"to go\" (DEDR 4572)."
            }
          ]
